    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Faisal Ismail recently assumed the position of Interim Director for CIME. Dr Ismail is an Associate Professor and Gastroenterologist, as well as Vice-Chair, Education in the Department of Medicine at AKU. Dr Ismail is an educator with a keen interest in Healthcare Simulation. He is a Certified Healthcare Simulation Educator (CHSE), a qualification bestowed by the Society for Simulation in Healthcare (SSH) and has a Masters' degree in Healthcare Simulation from the University of Alabama in Birmingham, USA.",
